    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD WACC. Risk-free ~4.2% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~0.9 -> cost of equity ~8.7%; debt ~$29.5B against ~$424B market cap (~6.5% weight) at ~3.5% after tax -> ~8.4%, rounded to 8.5%. Same WACC in every scenario: risk is carried by the scenario paths and weights, not by a WACC premium.",
